{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12136","headline":"天门谷题孙逸人石壁 · 钱起","name":"天门谷题孙逸人石壁","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"崖石乱流处，竹深斜照归。\n主人卧磻石，心耳涤清晖。\n春雷近作解，空谷半芳菲。\n云栋彩虹宿，药圃蝴蝶飞。\n恶嚣慕嘉遯，几夜瞻少微。\n相见竟何说，忘情同息机。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12136.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12136","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}